OL,3,GNEWSARare rhino's first steps captured
OL,4,Aon video at zoo
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe moment a rare greater one-horned
OL,7,Frhinoceros took its first steps at a
OL,8,Fzoo has been captured on video.
OL,10,FThe calf was born at Chester Zoo in
OL,11,FCheshire this week.
OL,13,FThe video shows 19-year-old mother Asha
OL,14,Fwith her newborn calf at their
OL,15,Fenclosure after Asha had been pregnant
OL,16,Ffor 15 months.
OL,18,FKeepers said both rhinos were in good
OL,19,Fhealth and the birth was an important
OL,20,Fstep in the conservation of the
OL,21,Fthreatened species.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
